text = "[b]Last minute shopping list for Emilio's birthday:[/b] 
 
 - Construction-themed cake decorations 
 - 23 Toy Hard Hats 
 - Yellow-flavoured Cake mix 
 - Yellow table cloth 
 - 38-year candle. 
 - Confetti launchers 
 - Emilio's favorite \"Manstyle\" Perfume as a gift from Aunt Talia."
